<QuestionLayout
  title="Does the Rust embedder use the same runtime.wasm?"
  description="Discover → execute → trace on one shared runtime contract. The web embedder loads the bundle's runtime.wasm. The Rust embedder links traverse-runtime natively and ships no separate runtime-WASM file."
